WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.290
- Is it true though, that
you got into some trouble

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.870
with your choice of footwear
on the show for your character?

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.190
- Yeah, it wasn't necessarily my choice.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.640
It was an amazing Tina
Fey and Robert joke.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.710
Yeah, yeah, there you go.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.300
In the pilot, my
character wears flip flops

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.131
with all of his suits.

00:00:17.131 --> 00:00:19.700
There was, just a throw away line

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.230
where his daughter says,

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.780
why are you wearing
flip flops with a suit?

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.650
And I say that I have
podiatric claustrophobia,

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.880
I don't know if it's a thing

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.760
but the character will
not have that anymore

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.930
because you could hear me coming.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.000
You could hear my flip-flops
coming a mile away

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.060
in every scene.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.050
- I can't wear flip flops
because that reason.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.480
I don't know how people wear flip flops

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.670
without all the noise.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:41.503
Like I don't understand it.

00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:43.000
- I don't like the feeling
between my first two toes!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.629
- [Kelly] Me neither, me neither!

00:00:44.629 --> 00:00:45.568
- I'm a highly sensitive person!

00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:47.190
- Me, I don't like that on my toes either.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.910
Literally, my stylists
shared these shoes to put on,

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.830
and I was like, nope I'm
not putting my toe in there!

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.270
- It should be socially acceptable

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.810
to wear those novelty shoes

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.843
that look like giant foam sneakers.

00:00:56.843 --> 00:00:57.676
(laughter)

00:00:57.676 --> 00:01:00.460
- Clown shoes.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.250
- Have you ever made any of
your own wardrobe choices?

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.380
- No, you've never don't
want me doing that.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.430
- Wait, you didn't pick any of those hats?

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:10.350
- No, I was like a mopey gothy teenager.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.790
Like I wasn't, I was not,
I'm still, I'm not a fancy,

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.650
this is all just smoke and mirrors.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.080
- You're not mopey!

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.900
- When I was a teenager,
I was, you don't know me!

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.690
- I know you, I was like,
whatever, you're dead.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:25.323
- The cameras turn off sometimes.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.717
- And then we become different people.

